        "question_type": "single_choice",
        "question_title": "Three mutually externally tangent circles have radii \\(R_1\\), \\(R_2\\), and \\(R_3\\). Their pairwise centre distances satisfy \\(R_1+R_2=13\\,\\mathrm{cm}\\), \\(R_2+R_3=15\\,\\mathrm{cm}\\), and \\(R_3+R_1=14\\,\\mathrm{cm}\\). Find \\(\\left(R_1,R_2,R_3\\right)\\).",
